  "description": "JAMPOG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C146 H188 Cl8 Eu8 N32 O58 Zn4 4+,2(Cl4 Zn1 2-). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu6 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu7 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu8 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 1 O neighbors; Zn2 (Zn) has 1 O neighbors; Zn3 (Zn) has 1 O neighbors; Zn4 (Zn) has 1 O neighbors; Zn5 (Zn) has 0 O neighbors; Zn6 (Zn) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 10 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.659-3.695 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.22-102.13°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Eu8Zn4L6Cl8(solvent)n][ZnCl4]2.",
